Subject: [PATCH] fix: batch Windows claim repair ACL hardening

---
 lib/kernel/legacy-claim-repair.js       | 38 ++++++++++++++++--------
 lib/kernel/sqlite-driver.js             | 39 ++++++++++++++++++++++---
 scripts/legacy-claim-repair.js          |  8 ++++-
